= \\u03a3 rs-gaap revenue leaves\", \"rule_origin\": \"native\", \"rule_pattern\": \"RollUp\", \"rule_severity\": \"error\", \"rule_target\": {\"target_kind\": \"element\", \"target_ref_id\": \"b26a6cd4-072f-5bf2-b5d3-ebf928150d6c\"}, \"rule_variables\": [{\"variable_name\": \"Revenues\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:Revenues\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax\"}]}, {\"id\": \"3562e6a7-70dd-544f-9828-cc9cbbcca802\", \"rule_category\": \"FundamentalAccountingConceptRelation\", \"rule_expression\": \"$IncomeLossFromContinuingOperations = ($IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesExtraordinaryItemsNoncontrollingInterest - $IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit)\", \"rule_message\": \"Calculation rollup: rs-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperations = PreTax \\u2212 IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit\", \"rule_origin\": \"native\", \"rule_pattern\": \"RollUp\", \"rule_severity\": \"error\", \"rule_target\": {\"target_kind\": \"element\", \"target_ref_id\": \"d60cabda-7060-5aff-ac98-96371606a738\"}, \"rule_variables\": [{\"variable_name\": \"IncomeLossFromContinuingOperations\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperations\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesExtraordinaryItemsNoncontrollingInterest\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesExtraordinaryItemsNoncontrollingInterest\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit\"}]}, {\"id\": \"4fdf61ff-ec5d-5cb2-8bcd-aa584ad2e768\", \"rule_category\": \"FundamentalAccountingConceptRelation\", \"rule_expression\": \"$NetIncomeLoss = ($IncomeLossFromContinuingOperations + $IncomeLossFromDiscontinuedOperationsNetOfTax)\", \"rule_message\": \"Calculation rollup: rs-gaap:NetIncomeLoss = ContinuingOps + DiscontinuedOps\", \"rule_origin\": \"native\", \"rule_