: \"IncreaseDecreaseInAccruedLiabilities\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:IncreaseDecreaseInAccruedLiabilities\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"IncreaseDecreaseInAccruedIncomeTaxesPayable\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:IncreaseDecreaseInAccruedIncomeTaxesPayable\"}]}, {\"id\": \"a9a20115-13a0-5511-8a6e-396596ccb2a9\", \"rule_category\": \"FundamentalAccountingConceptRelation\", \"rule_expression\": \"$CashAndCashEquivalentsPeriodIncreaseDecrease = ($NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities + $NetCashProvidedByUsedInInvestingActivities + $NetCashProvidedByUsedInFinancingActivities + $EffectOfExchangeRateOnCash)\", \"rule_message\": \"Calculation rollup: rs-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsPeriodIncreaseDecrease = Op + Inv + Fin + Exchange\", \"rule_origin\": \"native\", \"rule_pattern\": \"RollUp\", \"rule_severity\": \"error\", \"rule_target\": {\"target_kind\": \"element\", \"target_ref_id\": \"353f790f-1ed1-5b91-880d-8029b4b687cf\"}, \"rule_variables\": [{\"variable_name\": \"CashAndCashEquivalentsPeriodIncreaseDecrease\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsPeriodIncreaseDecrease\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"NetCashProvidedByUsedInInvestingActivities\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:NetCashProvidedByUsedInInvestingActivities\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"NetCashProvidedByUsedInFinancingActivities\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:NetCashProvidedByUsedInFinancingActivities\"}, {\"variable_name\": \"EffectOfExchangeRateOnCash\", \"variable_qname\": \"rs-gaap:EffectOfExchangeRateOnCash\"}]}, {\"id\": \"b20105e5-8a56-59c8-9092-028b61168338\", \"rule_category\": \"FundamentalAccountingConceptRelation\", \"rule_expression\": \"$NetCashProvidedByUsedInInvestingActivities = ($PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment + $ProceedsFromSaleOfPropertyPlantAndEquipment + $PaymentsToAcquireInvestments + $ProceedsFromSaleMaturityAndColl